{"parse": {"title": "成你本所是-04", "pageid": 139755, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-03\" title=\"成你本所是-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">成你本所是-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-05\" title=\"成你本所是-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">成你本所是</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A5.E5.87.BA.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"日出之前\">日出之前</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 日出之前</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Darkest Hour</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_wurenqu2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_wurenqu2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲曾笑着说：火焰是最贪吃的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳对此曾不屑一顾：她自己就是胃口最好的，力气最大的，身体最强壮的缇威尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>爸爸……妈妈！你们在哪儿？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记录着缇威尔世代孩子们身高变化的门框，为纪念第一只尘酿鹰幼崽诞生而修建的鸟房，妈妈多沃卡从故乡高地移栽而来的橡树……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高温让她的眼睛开始不受控地流下泪水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你说得对……火焰比我还要调皮……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她踉踉跄跄地冲进火场，用于阻隔火焰的神秘术刚覆盖上皮肤，就被上爬的热浪一口吞下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>好疼！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>庄园一片焰色摇曳，木枝燃烧的尖啸盖过了夏夜的一切低语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>大家……都在哪儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹰啸割开了滞重的焚烟，让一丝黯淡的月光落在了火场中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>爸爸……爸爸！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>像一颗跌跌撞撞的流星，她一路向着引力中心点奔去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534604.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳父亲：</div><div>别过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲的嘶吼硬生生截停了她的降落，这是她从未听过的撕心裂肺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲严肃到近乎扭曲的表情让她感到一股前所未有的陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳下意识又向前走了两步，试图看清火幕后的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她踢到了一个软软的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……格温？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发少女静卧于焦土中，她熄灭的火焰——那曾在阳光下跃动的红发——如今枯焦如黑色的雪。灰烬成了她最后安眠的床榻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在她的怀里蜷着一团灰色的幼小生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它翼边新生的飞羽，曾能切开风、折射光，如今却像被狂风扑打过的火种，只余下疲惫的、失去光泽的绒毛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格温……格温姐姐？你不要睡在这里，快逃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳听见自己的声音像锈蚀的刀刃刮过砂石。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她颤抖着揉了揉眼睛，试图看透火焰帷幕后的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534604.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳父亲：</div><div>阿德琳，快跑！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她穿过火焰，看清了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有的希望与侥幸都落入了深渊里，仿佛燎原之火熄灭后，最先冷却的那片余烬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一些家人成了火焰孤岛上的黑色剪影。而更多的缇威尔，如同格温那样，像熟透的果子般坠地，在焦土中淌出赤色的汁水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想要尖叫，但声音哽在了过分紧张的喉咙里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">外来者：</div><div>抓住她！她会用神秘术！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳猛地回头，并不熟练的昏睡咒只让拦路的敌人沉眠了不到半刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步虚浮的敌人提着斧子，被煤烟熏黑的脸犹如恶鬼一般。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者：</div><div>你说你被这个小毛头放倒了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>外来者们发出一阵哄堂大笑，以绝望为柴薪的火焰于他们只是残酷节日中的余兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534604.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳父亲：</div><div>别碰她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的父亲猛地挣扎了一下，却没能挣脱附上了神秘术的绳索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳呼吸急促地举起了术杖，这才发现火星已经咬上了桦树枝，手中的术杖不知在何时已经燃成了一截焦炭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>爸、爸爸……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者：</div><div>真感人。我们当然可以放她走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>外来者露出了一个阴冷的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者：</div><div>你们这些自诩伟大的保护者，根本不知道自己的目光有多短浅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者：</div><div>隐身、高速、忠诚——它们是古代神秘学留给现代的宝物。拥有一只这样的神奇飞鸟，等于拥有了一支空军小队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者：</div><div>交出多少尘酿鹰，我们就能给你们留下多少活口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534604.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳父亲：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>尘酿鹰……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的视线缓慢地移到格林杜尔身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是缇威尔家最强壮的成年尘酿鹰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是父亲的朋友、搭档，她的监护人、玩伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534604.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳父亲：</div><div>阿德琳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳听见了一声无可奈何的呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这声音与她记忆中的某个画面严丝合缝地重叠。就像是她过去每次调皮时，父亲摇头发出的那半是责备、半是纵容的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534604.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-534604.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534604.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳父亲：</div><div>格林杜尔，带她走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨鸟没有犹豫，振翅而起。阿德琳甚至来不及惊愕，只感觉到后领一紧，整个陆地便被从她脚下瞬间抽走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>不、不要！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>咕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不依不饶的挣扎只换来了更用力的振翅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！放我下去！我不要走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>成年尘酿鹰的速度比风还要快。在阿德琳逐渐模糊的视线里，家园的绿茵正在不可逆转的燃烧中褪色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-533705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-533705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-533705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我愿以肉身为凭，求终得见那未曾降生常世之灵！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>？！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格林杜尔在接近地面的半空松开了紧握的爪，阿德琳重重跌在柔软的草甸中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>成年尘酿鹰收拢羽翼，山般静立在她面前，不会言语的金色眼瞳深深凝视着哭泣的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533706.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-533706.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533706.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>走……走啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从草地里爬了起来，用尽全身的力气推搡着巨鸟。明明是轻盈的飞禽，却让阿德琳感觉对方有山一般沉重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>求求你救救他们，你别管我……快去啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嘶哑的哭喊在风中破碎，巨鸟金色的瞳孔剧烈收缩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它收拢的羽翼微微张开，本能地倾向眼前颤抖的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"533704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"533704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-533704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-533704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>求求你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳沾满泪与灰的手贴上它的喙缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>……咕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它深深看了阿德琳一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双翼完全展开，在草地上扇出一道道浪。它逆着月光腾空而起，向着火光外泄的谷地中心飞去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳瘫坐在草地上，夜半的寒露将她的心撕开一个呼啸的空洞。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "成你本所是-04"}}